### Optimising feeds to support ecosystem-based aquaculture

I am current working with [Professor Julia Blanchard](https://discover.utas.edu.au/Julia.Blanchard){target="_blank"} on an ARC Linkage Grant developing new ways of assessing the environmental impacts of alternate sources of protein in fish food. See the full project and the latest research outputs [here](https://sustainableaquafeedsproject.org/){target="_blank"}.

